"2026-02-08T18:57:52Z","updated_at":"2026-04-20T14:24:08Z","closed_at":"2026-04-20T14:23:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/116052","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116052","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116052.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116052.patch","merged_at":"2026-04-20T14:23:48Z"},"body":"Part of an effort to cleanup our repository root of file bloat. This migrates all the relevant icon/logo files located in the repository root to a new location: `misc/dist/common/`. We already use `misc/dist/` for several platform-specific data batches—sometimes even using icons themselves—so it made the most sense to consolidate these in a `common` container. All references to the old file paths have been updated as needed. Similarly, `LOGO_LICENSE` was moved as well, now residing alongside the images as `misc/dist/common/LICENSE.txt` The only other change was moving `misc/dist/icon_console.svg` to the `windows` subfolder, as that file is only relevant for Windows (might be vestigial?)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.gi